<title>CHINA: China yuan market volume up 51.09 pct in March.</title>
<headline>China yuan market volume up 51.09 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover on China's local currency interbank market was 51.7 billion yuan in March with an average daily turnover of 2.462 billion yuan, up 51.09 percent from February, the China Securities newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 60-day and seven-day contracts were the most actively traded, the newspaper said. The market also trades contracts of one, 20, 30, 90 and 120 days duration.</p>
